# Terraform working files. The state lives in Azure Storage (see README); .terraform.lock.hcl IS committed.
**/.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
crash.log
crash.*.log
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json

# Tenant identifiers of each environment (<workspace>.entra.tfvars): kept out of git like every tenant value. The
# .example files and the other <workspace>.tfvars (sizing, no tenant value) are committed.
*.entra.tfvars
terraform.tfvars
